ealthy. v2.3.1-rc and v2.3.1 are both unhealthy.\n- **Approval:** No change-manager approval was needed, because v2.3.0 has already been healthy in production.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 describes the failure, the rollback, and the release history. Its follow-up items are to confirm the error rate stays recovered and to investigate v2.3.1 before it is redeployed.", "type": "text"}]}]}